<title>POLAND: GPRD FEB NET GROWS LOSS TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD FEB NET GROWS LOSS TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.14 vs   0.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.14 vs   0.98</p>
<p> Operating loss	 2.03 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Sales		    2.59 vs   1.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 4.44 vs   2.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.44 vs   2.28 </p>
<p> Operating loss	 4.34 vs   2.27</p>
<p> Sales		    4.73 vs   3.24</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish road builder is Gdanskie</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
